Package: orac-branding
Version: 1.3.2-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Rick Masterson <rickm1982@gmail.com>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: plymouth, plymouth-label
Recommends: shadowfetch-themes, plasma-workspace, papirus-icon-theme, fastfetch, sddm, qml6-module-qtmultimedia
Description: ORAC workstation branding for Shadowfetch
 The ORAC look layered on Shadowfetch's own branding and themes packages:
 a Plymouth boot splash with real boot progress, boot messages and an
 encrypted-drive unlock prompt; a Plasma look-and-feel (org.orac.workstation)
 with its KSplash login splash; and the ORAC Orb, Minimal and Workstation
 wallpaper sets; an ORAC terminal banner for fastfetch (orac-terminal-theme
 apply); an ORAC Void colour scheme and profile for Konsole; and the ORAC
 login message (/etc/motd), with Shadowfetch's kept and restored on removal.
 .
 Also: a GRUB boot menu theme, an SDDM login theme with the ORAC core
 looping behind a glass panel, Orac gradient mouse cursors, an Orac Plasma
 style for the panel and widgets, and the Orac Living Core animated
 wallpaper.
 .
 Installing registers everything but switches nothing at boot. Switch the
 boot menu, boot splash and login screen together with:
 sudo orac-boot-theme apply
 and back with: sudo orac-boot-theme revert
